{"id":"b78f1aa00040ca7f","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k.md","title":"ZFC Inner Core Model K","display":"df-zfc-inner-core-model-k — ZFC Inner Core Model K","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-core-model-k — ZFC Inner Core Model K","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class]]","[[58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner3-iterable-mouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-core-model-k</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-core-model-k — ZFC Inner Core Model K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" href=\"?note=5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md\">../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a762f9d6c343e3a0\" href=\"?note=a762f9d6c343e3a0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class\">58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse\">58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"695d439fd8428da4\" href=\"?note=695d439fd8428da4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-iterable-mouse\">58-df-zfc-inner3-iterable-mouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ee467bd1d472e5f\" href=\"?note=8ee467bd1d472e5f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse\">58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,C,M,\\varphi,\\vec a\\in V\">\\(K,C,M,\\varphi,\\vec a\\in V\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,C\">\\(K,C\\)</span> 是真类的集合编码</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}:V\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}:V\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> (类码的真类外延, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a762f9d6c343e3a0\" href=\"?note=a762f9d6c343e3a0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class\">58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3IterableMouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3IterableMouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (由上述依赖导入)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PM}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathsf{PM}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (本文件定义的全 sound 可迭代内 premouse 谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c,\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c,\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> (集合 premouse 与真类 premouse 的固定元理论比较关系)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CoreCand}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathsf{CoreCand}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (本文件定义的真类核心模型候选码谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}k}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PM}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec E\\;\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\land\n\\exists\\Sigma\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInner3IterableMouse}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S(M,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}k}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{PM}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec E\\;\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\\land\n\\exists\\Sigma\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInner3IterableMouse}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S(M,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}k\\text{-}candidate}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathsf{CoreCand}(C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\varphi,\\vec a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\varphi,\\vec a)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(\\operatorname{Ext}(C))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathsf{PM}(M)\\to M\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c,\\mathsf{meta}}\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}k\\text{-}candidate}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathsf{CoreCand}(C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\varphi,\\vec a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\varphi,\\vec a)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(\\operatorname{Ext}(C))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathsf{PM}(M)\\to M\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c,\\mathsf{meta}}\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}k}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S(K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{CoreCand}(K)\\land\n\\forall C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathsf{CoreCand}(C)\\to\n\\operatorname{Ext}(K)\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c,\\mathsf{meta}}\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}core\\text{-}model\\text{-}k}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerCoreModelK}_S(K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{CoreCand}(K)\\land\n\\forall C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathsf{CoreCand}(C)\\to\n\\operatorname{Ext}(K)\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm c,\\mathsf{meta}}\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> is only a code.  Its extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}(K)\\)</span> is the\nproper-class inner model compared with set premice; this prevents the\nset-premouse/proper-class-inner-model collapse.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-inner-model.md","sta